This project is an unofficial port of GNU Emacs 31.1 to HarmonyOS.  The Emacs
fork is maintained at https://github.com/harmonyos-emacs/emacs and includes
modifications for the OHOS window system, input, rendering and runtime
integration.  The application shell, ArkTS/C++ host bridge, build scripts and
renderer are maintained at https://github.com/harmonyos-emacs/hmos-emacs.

Corresponding source for the distributed HAP is the combination of both
repositories plus the pinned third-party archives under third_party/src.

